Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep running along, watch as we pass by,\Nas we raise our flag, up high in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.72,0:00:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.63,0:00:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,here we go now, sailing through the\Nendless ocean, facing all that comes by.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.56,0:00:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's look for our treasure. Nobody has\Never got to witness with their own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.46,0:00:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All we have to do is keep believing in our\Ndreams, And let our heart lead the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.70,0:00:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Then once we got all the\Nothers left is to go,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.86,0:00:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,When we face the dark and stormy weather?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.30,0:00:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep the pace, we'll\Nlink our hearts together!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.26,0:00:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'm sure we'll make it through!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.40,0:00:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.84,0:00:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep running along, keep running along!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.52,0:00:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Start raising our flag as we journey on!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.48,0:00:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Though our chances are close to\Nnone, We won't back down from anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.62,0:01:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start off the chase!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.02,0:01:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start off the chase!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.54,0:01:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Toward our own dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.04,0:01:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,While keeping the pace!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.50,0:01:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,With a compass pointing to our goal!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.82,0:01:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't stop till we've gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.22,0:01:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Around the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.16,0:01:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Start me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.12,0:01:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep running along!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.00,0:01:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep running along!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.44,0:01:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And we'll never stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.06,0:01:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Till we're at the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.44,0:01:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way that we'll ever quit!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.76,0:01:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't keep heading for tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.28,0:01:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start up the chase!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.04,0:01:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start up the chase!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.54,0:01:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I see through your eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.08,0:01:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What we'll have to face!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.48,0:01:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,All the memories we'll say in our hearts!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.10,0:01:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never let them go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.38,0:01:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Brand new world!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.02,0:01:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.52,0:01:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.38,0:02:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.29,0:02:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you get your body back to normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.58,0:02:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Some big bathtub fell from\Nthe sky and smashed to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.14,0:02:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Water went everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.30,0:02:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Must have broke the spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.60,0:02:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But more importantly, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.70,0:02:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you just fall in\Nlove with me all over?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.02,0:02:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish that bathtub had\Ndropped right on your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.42,0:02:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Sop!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.64,0:02:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's to the point where not even\NSniper or King is in my name, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.12,0:02:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.78,0:02:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried, but I couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.40,0:02:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,you're alive that's
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.04,0:03:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,what matters everyone has things that they
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.12,0:03:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,can do and things that they can't yeah but
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.34,0:03:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,both of you take a
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.46,0:03:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,look outside huh oh no
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.02,0:03:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,it's the Gates of Justice\Nthey're starting to open
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.54,0:03:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.22,0:03:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If those gates open up and\NRobin goes through them,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.16,0:03:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,we won't have any way to follow her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.44,0:03:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll cross waters\Ninfested with sea kings,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.68,0:03:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,and beyond that is either the\NUndersea Prison or Navy Headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.44,0:04:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Everywhere on the other side of\Nthose gates is beyond our reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.66,0:04:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll lose her forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.60,0:04:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But I thought Luffy would\Nhave caught up to her by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.86,0:04:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.77,0:04:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get through!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.14,0:04:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin's waiting for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.10,0:04:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.50,0:04:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never see your friend again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.32,0:04:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This is as far as you're going to get.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.76,0:04:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That isn't going to work on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.82,0:05:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.40,0:05:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I said come? We're going to the bridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.62,0:05:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I gonna make it in time?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.26,0:05:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I sure hope either this\Nnumber three or four key?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.96,0:05:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Will unlock those damn handcuffs!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.82,0:05:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.18,0:05:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.30,0:05:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Go this way, go this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.48,0:05:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Chimney, hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.46,0:05:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This tower's in the line of fire, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.42,0:05:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Granny.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.90,0:05:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't show them the way,\Neverybody's gonna get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.84,0:05:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Meow, meow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.20,0:06:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,In hindsight, picking me as your opponent\Nwasn't the best idea, now was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.48,0:06:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let us on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.70,0:06:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.61,0:06:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This train is full!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.98,0:06:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have to find another way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.40,0:06:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.48,0:06:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you were just playing it cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.24,0:06:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You were pretending to be tied up\Nwith your own rope the whole time!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.16,0:06:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'd say we don't have much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.74,0:06:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What about Big Bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.12,0:06:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the Straw Hats?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.64,0:06:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Those guys are all unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.24,0:06:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to worry about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.76,0:06:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.67,0:06:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to hurry and get\Noff this island! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.28,0:06:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten battleships just departed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.36,0:06:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They set sail towards the\Nisland of Enies Lobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.70,0:06:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the worst situation I can imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.76,0:07:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But in every situation, even one as\Nbad as this, there's always a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.32,0:07:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.84,0:07:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave this guy's key to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.94,0:07:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Changing my opponent, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.26,0:07:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.80,0:07:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, I'm gonna stay here\Nand do what you can't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.82,0:07:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to do what I can't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.30,0:07:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.88,0:07:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Think carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.14,0:07:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Read the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.32,0:07:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we have you, there's\Nstill a chance we can save Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.28,0:07:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear me, Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.92,0:07:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you have me, there's\Na chance we can save Robin?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.34,0:08:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And shave.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.98,0:08:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of here! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.20,0:08:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Usopp! Ow! Geez!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.04,0:08:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still injured!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.95,0:08:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mess it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.87,0:08:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Staying here and getting\Nkilled will hurt more!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.96,0:08:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a pretty good point!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.38,0:08:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you were supposed\Nto be some kind of hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.14,0:08:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess you're nothing but Todd.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.40,0:08:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait now I get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.12,0:08:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Get what we can save? Robin?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.76,0:08:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I'm here, we can\Nsave her! Damn it! Whoa! Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.40,0:08:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really have to get\Nso carried away about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.50,0:08:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.41,0:08:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.33,0:09:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait up! I've got it! I've got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.30,0:09:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We can save her!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.64,0:09:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you shut up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.04,0:09:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not exactly something\Nwe want the wolf to?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.86,0:09:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I'll get to\Nkill them after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.72,0:09:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn. Direct hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.06,0:09:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Will that piss me off?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.88,0:09:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Tick finger pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.52,0:09:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Asien!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.78,0:09:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Asien!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.18,0:10:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.34,0:10:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think I even felt that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.82,0:10:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This punk's got some serious kicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.96,0:10:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That technique you guys use to\Nmake your body strong as iron?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.48,0:10:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's a really big pain in my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.90,0:10:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Tip his kick, lone wolf!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.52,0:10:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Azkoth, Longe, Tendron, Gatshek,\NHazeera, Po, Twiso, Giri, Po!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.30,0:10:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.38,0:10:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,How many times have I got to tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.86,0:11:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Your kicks do nothing to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.06,0:11:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the only master of the\Nsix powers that can move
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.86,0:11:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,around freely while using\Nthe iron-body technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.80,0:11:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're telling me this like I care.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.42,0:11:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he actually staying down?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.78,0:11:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Nicely done.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.52,0:11:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for a worthy\Nopponent, and I've finally found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.62,0:12:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, if you don't mind me asking, a\Nfavor — save Robin for me. What, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.92,0:12:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,are you talking about Nobody knows
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.42,0:12:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,this but robin is this is difficult
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.04,0:12:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,for me to say but she's my long lost
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.50,0:12:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,little Sister she's what i had no
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.40,0:12:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,idea i mean she never said anything\Nabout having an older brother before
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.82,0:12:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not surprised i can't\Nhelp her now i'm not strong
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.16,0:12:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,enough so please i'm on my\Nknees begging You you have to
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.46,0:12:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,save robin sure i can do\Nthat leave it to me i'll just
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.78,0:12:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,pick up this key here and\Nthen I'll be off to save her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.52,0:12:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You really think I'd buy that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.04,0:13:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,My darling Robin is your\Nlong-lost little sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.90,0:13:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Dumbass.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.88,0:13:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have to kick you\Ntwice as hard for that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.68,0:13:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hasn't it sunk in yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.24,0:13:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You can fight as hard as you possibly can,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.10,0:13:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,but I am not going to let\Nyou through those doors!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.34,0:13:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.06,0:13:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Because no matter how hard you\Nfight, I'm still gonna get past you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.50,0:13:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt that we'll ever agree on this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.76,0:13:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So there's no sense in us discussing it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.26,0:13:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And I don't have time for talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.06,0:13:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.34,0:14:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I finally starting to make\Nan impression on you, wolf?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.44,0:14:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! That's my key!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.92,0:14:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, you did give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.44,0:14:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.68,0:14:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Body Kenpo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.88,0:14:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Later!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.86,0:14:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.00,0:14:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who's supposed to\Ntrick people around here, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.48,0:14:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you mock me and steal my gimmick!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.48,0:14:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Shake!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.92,0:14:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Party!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.10,0:14:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, bloody Kimbo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.56,0:14:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We so shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.72,0:14:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.50,0:14:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, Swerve!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.04,0:14:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm pissed off!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.38,0:14:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to get hurt\Nthat bad, I'll oblige you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.48,0:14:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Iron body, kin-fu, wolf plantain stance!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.16,0:15:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolf hunt, high speed, crack!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.08,0:15:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Heavy wolf paw! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.82,0:15:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How's that iron-body punch feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.78,0:15:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably gonna ache for the rest\Nof your short, pathetic life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.74,0:15:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Moonwalk!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.54,0:15:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And let's kick!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.16,0:15:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You must fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.66,0:15:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a pretty stupid move you made back\Nthere trying to steal my key and run off
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.20,0:15:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,while I'm still alive\NI'm a wolf you dolt I
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.46,0:16:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,won't stop chasing you\Nuntil you're in my jaws
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.76,0:16:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Still hanging in there huh I'm not going
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.04,0:16:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,anywhere pal I'm not\Nabout to get killed either
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.34,0:16:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm not gonna forgive you. Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.68,0:16:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Upset with the way we've treated\NRobin getting all emotional will only
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.80,0:16:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,clutter up your mind During a fight\Ndon't waste all of your precious
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.96,0:16:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,time pitying that hopeless fool of a\Nwoman when You should be busy trying
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.88,0:16:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,to think of a way to get out of here\Nalive watch your damn mouth wolf
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.18,0:16:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't want to see me mad. I\Ntend to overheat when I'm mad. you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.64,0:16:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,aren't going to win this battle\NBy tossing around threats it's
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.40,0:16:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,pretty obvious how badly injured\Nyou are though I'm more than
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.50,0:16:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,happy To put you out of your\Nmisery iron body ken po devil wolf
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.38,0:17:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and laugh it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.38,0:17:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the last chance you'll have.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.52,0:17:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get the point of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.52,0:17:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You're trying to make me\Ndizzy from watching you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.02,0:17:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.42,0:17:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Why's his foot all red like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.54,0:17:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The foot of the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.22,0:17:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Diablo Jamba.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.06,0:17:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The heat I generated from all that spinning\Nwill burn my kick straight through you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.10,0:17:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's glowing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.80,0:18:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,it burns the heat of its destructive\Npower burns hotter than the flames of hell
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.54,0:18:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm burning up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.08,0:18:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Even my bones feel like they're melting!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.38,0:18:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart-body won't work!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.06,0:18:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell can one\Nkick possibly do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.80,0:18:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.71,0:18:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't jump in the air while\Nyou're fighting a six powers master!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.52,0:18:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,God bless, champa!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.94,0:18:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Premier, action!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.00,0:18:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.02,0:18:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What a rookie mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.14,0:18:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You got in a big hurry to\Nwin and you got sloppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.88,0:18:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So long, sucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.58,0:19:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Moonlight to the finger pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.42,0:19:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So you knocked one hand away. Big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.84,0:19:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If your other kick could\Nhave landed in time,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.12,0:19:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,you might have stopped my\Nfinger pistol from hitting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.20,0:19:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I had no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.26,0:19:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I had to get you close enough to\Nfinish you off with my last kick. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.90,0:19:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Diablo Jamba?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.80,0:19:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.44,0:19:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Ramage!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.78,0:19:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,John!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.96,0:19:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,God may have created food,\Nbut the devil created spices.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.58,0:20:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think that cake was hot,\Nmy heart was burning even hotter.
